"# Launch film, all versions

Reviewers: Sarah, Dev
Exported: 2026-11-21 14:05 UTC

## Version 1

### Sarah, 0:03.0 (paused 4s)
![overview](media/10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/overview.jpg)

"The opening title is too small."

Moments:
- moment-01 at 0:03.0, pause, (50%, 50%) ![](media/10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/moment-01.jpg)

## Version 2

### Sarah, 0:03.0 (paused 4s)
![overview](media/20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/overview.jpg)

"Tighten up the cut, please."

Moments:
- moment-01 at 0:03.0, pause, (50%, 50%) ![](media/20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/moment-01.jpg)

### Dev, 0:12.4 (paused 34s) covering 0:09.0 to 0:12.4
![overview](media/30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/overview.jpg)

"so this [📍 moment-02: top-left, 12%/8%] logo is the old one and the text here [📍 moment-03: bottom-centre, 48%/81%, clicked, zoomed in] runs on too long"

Moments:
